<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>{{ project_name }} · 角色库双向通道</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #fafaf7;
    --fg: #1e1e1e;
    --muted: #6b7280;
    --border: #d1d5db;
    --card: #ffffff;
    --accent: #2563eb;
    --danger: #dc2626;
    --success: #059669;
    --drop-highlight: #dbeafe;
    --global-band: #eef2ff;
    --project-band: #fef3c7;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 20px 28px 40px;
    font-family: -apple-system, "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--fg);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border);
    padding-bottom: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; }
  .hint {
    background: #fffbeb;
    border: 1px solid #fde68a;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-size: 13px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    color: #78350f;
  }
  .hint strong { color: #78350f; }
  .gate {
    background: #fef2f2;
    border: 2px dashed var(--danger);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  .gate input[type="checkbox"] {
    margin-right: 8px;
    transform: scale(1.1);
  }
  .gate.active {
    background: #f0fdf4;
    border-color: var(--success);
    color: #065f46;
  }
  .panel-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 20px;
    min-height: 500px;
  }
  .panel {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  .panel-header {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding-bottom: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .panel-header h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .panel-global .panel-header { background: var(--global-band); margin: -14px -16px 10px; padding: 10px 16px; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; }
  .panel-project .panel-header { background: var(--project-band); margin: -14px -16px 10px; padding: 10px 16px; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; }
  .panel-body {
    flex: 1;
    min-height: 400px;
    padding: 4px;
    border: 2px dashed transparent;
    border-radius: 6px;
    transition: background 0.15s, border-color 0.15s;
  }
  .panel-body.drop-over {
    background: var(--drop-highlight);
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }
  .role-card {
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 10px 12px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    cursor: grab;
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  .role-card:active { cursor: grabbing; }
  .role-card.dragging { opacity: 0.4; }
  .role-card .role-id {
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 2px;
  }
  .role-card .role-meta {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 12px;
  }
  .role-card .role-verified {
    display: inline-block;
    background: #d1fae5;
    color: #065f46;
    padding: 1px 6px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-size: 11px;
    margin-left: 4px;
  }
  .category {
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .category-title {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--muted);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    padding: 4px 6px;
    border-bottom: 1px dotted var(--border);
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .log-section {
    margin-top: 20px;
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 14px 16px;
  }
  .log-section h3 {
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .log-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    max-height: 200px;
    overflow-y: auto;
    font-family: "SF Mono", Consolas, monospace;
    font-size: 12px;
  }
  .log-list li {
    padding: 4px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px dotted var(--border);
  }
  .log-list li.upgrade { color: var(--success); }
  .log-list li.clone { color: var(--accent); }
  .log-list li.reject { color: var(--danger); }
  .empty {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 13px;
    padding: 20px 8px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  footer {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 12px;
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 20px;
  }
  .btn {
    font-size: 12px;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: #ffffff;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .btn:hover { background: var(--accent); color: #ffffff; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <h1>🎭 角色库双向通道 · {{ project_name }}</h1>
  <div>最后更新：{{ generated_at }}</div>
</header>

<div class="hint">
  <strong>操作说明：</strong>拖拽角色卡在两栏间移动。
  <br>· <strong>全局 → 项目（左→右）</strong>：克隆继承，用户确认即可。
  <br>· <strong>项目 → 全局（右→左）</strong>：升级，需先勾选下方"已跨项目验证"门，否则拒绝。
  <br>· <strong>不做</strong>自动升级 / 强制同步 / 命令行升级，一切走本可视化。
</div>

<div class="gate" id="approval-gate">
  <label>
    <input type="checkbox" id="verified-check">
    <strong>已跨项目验证（≥ 2 个项目确认有效）</strong>——勾选后才能执行右→左（项目→全局）升级
  </label>
</div>

<div class="panel-grid">

  <div class="panel panel-global">
    <div class="panel-header">
      <h2>🌐 全局角色库</h2>
      <span style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted);">&lt;skill根&gt;/roles-library/</span>
    </div>
    <div class="panel-body" id="panel-global" data-panel="global">
      {% if global_roles %}
        {%- set ns = namespace(current_cat='') -%}
        {%- for r in global_roles -%}
        {%- if r.category != ns.current_cat -%}
        {%- if ns.current_cat %}</div>{% endif %}
        <div class="category">
          <div class="category-title">{{ r.category }}</div>
        {%- set ns.current_cat = r.category -%}
        {%- endif -%}
        <div class="role-card" draggable="true"
             data-id="{{ r.id }}"
             data-scope="global"
             data-category="{{ r.category }}"
             data-verified="{{ r.verified_projects | default([]) | length }}">
          <div class="role-id">{{ r.name | default(r.id) }}</div>
          <div class="role-meta">
            id: <code>{{ r.id }}</code>
            {% if r.verified_projects %}<span class="role-verified">验证于 {{ r.verified_projects | length }} 个项目</span>{% endif %}
          </div>
        </div>
        {%- endfor -%}
        </div>
      {% else %}
      <div class="empty">（全局角色库为空，从项目升级开始积累）</div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="panel panel-project">
    <div class="panel-header">
      <h2>📂 项目角色库</h2>
      <span style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted);">&lt;项目根&gt;/base/perspectives/</span>
    </div>
    <div class="panel-body" id="panel-project" data-panel="project">
      {% if project_roles %}
        {%- set ns2 = namespace(current_cat='') -%}
        {%- for r in project_roles -%}
        {%- if r.category != ns2.current_cat -%}
        {%- if ns2.current_cat %}</div>{% endif %}
        <div class="category">
          <div class="category-title">{{ r.category }}</div>
        {%- set ns2.current_cat = r.category -%}
        {%- endif -%}
        <div class="role-card" draggable="true"
             data-id="{{ r.id }}"
             data-scope="project"
             data-category="{{ r.category }}"
             data-verified="{{ r.verified_projects | default([]) | length }}">
          <div class="role-id">{{ r.name | default(r.id) }}</div>
          <div class="role-meta">
            id: <code>{{ r.id }}</code>
            {% if r.verified_projects %}<span class="role-verified">验证于 {{ r.verified_projects | length }} 个项目</span>{% endif %}
          </div>
        </div>
        {%- endfor -%}
        </div>
      {% else %}
      <div class="empty">（项目角色库为空，新建或从全局克隆）</div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>

</div>

<div class="log-section">
  <h3>📜 本次会话操作记录</h3>
  <ul class="log-list" id="log-list">
    <li class="empty">（尚无操作）</li>
  </ul>
  <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
    <button class="btn" id="export-log">导出 JSON（写入 .claude/role_manager-log.json）</button>
  </div>
</div>

<footer>
  由 <code>role_manager.py</code> 启动 · smarter-project v2 · 审批门规则见 references/roles-ops.md §4
</footer>

<script>
(function() {
  var logEntries = [];
  var logList = document.getElementById('log-list');
  var verifiedCheck = document.getElementById('verified-check');
  var gate = document.getElementById('approval-gate');

  verifiedCheck.addEventListener('change', function() {
    if (verifiedCheck.checked) {
      gate.classList.add('active');
    } else {
      gate.classList.remove('active');
    }
  });

  function renderLog() {
    if (logEntries.length === 0) {
      logList.innerHTML = '<li class="empty">（尚无操作）</li>';
      return;
    }
    logList.innerHTML = '';
    logEntries.forEach(function(e) {
      var li = document.createElement('li');
      li.className = e.type;
      li.textContent = '[' + e.time + '] ' + e.type.toUpperCase() + ' · ' + e.role_id + ' : ' + e.from + ' → ' + e.to + (e.note ? ' (' + e.note + ')' : '');
      logList.appendChild(li);
    });
  }

  function logAction(type, roleId, from, to, note) {
    var now = new Date();
    var stamp = now.toISOString().slice(0, 19).replace('T', ' ');
    logEntries.push({ type: type, role_id: roleId, from: from, to: to, time: stamp, note: note || '' });
    renderLog();
  }

  var cards = document.querySelectorAll('.role-card');
  cards.forEach(function(card) {
    card.addEventListener('dragstart', function(e) {
      card.classList.add('dragging');
      e.dataTransfer.setData('text/plain', JSON.stringify({
        id: card.dataset.id,
        scope: card.dataset.scope,
        category: card.dataset.category
      }));
      e.dataTransfer.effectAllowed = 'move';
    });
    card.addEventListener('dragend', function() {
      card.classList.remove('dragging');
    });
  });

  var panels = document.querySelectorAll('.panel-body');
  panels.forEach(function(panel) {
    panel.addEventListener('dragover', function(e) {
      e.preventDefault();
      e.dataTransfer.dropEffect = 'move';
      panel.classList.add('drop-over');
    });
    panel.addEventListener('dragleave', function() {
      panel.classList.remove('drop-over');
    });
    panel.addEventListener('drop', function(e) {
      e.preventDefault();
      panel.classList.remove('drop-over');
      var data = JSON.parse(e.dataTransfer.getData('text/plain'));
      var targetScope = panel.dataset.panel;
      var sourceScope = data.scope;

      if (sourceScope === targetScope) {
        logAction('clone', data.id, sourceScope, targetScope, '同栏内部移动（分类调整）');
        return;
      }

      // 跨栏：必须审批门通过（仅在右→左时）
      if (sourceScope === 'project' && targetScope === 'global') {
        if (!verifiedCheck.checked) {
          logAction('reject', data.id, sourceScope, targetScope, '未勾选"已跨项目验证"，拒绝升级');
          alert('⛔ 升级拒绝：请先勾选"已跨项目验证（≥ 2 个项目）"审批门。');
          return;
        }
        logAction('upgrade', data.id, sourceScope, targetScope, '已通过审批门，升级到全局');
      } else {
        // global → project = 克隆继承
        logAction('clone', data.id, sourceScope, targetScope, '全局克隆到项目');
      }

      // 将卡片 DOM 移到目标栏（不做服务端落盘，由 role_manager.py 接收 log 后处理）
      var draggedCard = document.querySelector('.role-card[data-id="' + data.id + '"][data-scope="' + sourceScope + '"]');
      if (draggedCard) {
        draggedCard.dataset.scope = targetScope;
        panel.appendChild(draggedCard);
      }
    });
  });

  document.getElementById('export-log').addEventListener('click', function() {
    var payload = {
      project: "{{ project_name }}",
      generated_at: new Date().toISOString(),
      actions: logEntries
    };
    var blob = new Blob([JSON.stringify(payload, null, 2)], { type: 'application/json' });
    var url = URL.createObjectURL(blob);
    var a = document.createElement('a');
    a.href = url;
    a.download = 'role_manager-log.json';
    a.click();
    URL.revokeObjectURL(url);
    alert('📥 已导出 role_manager-log.json\n请放入项目 .claude/ 目录，由 role_manager.py 后置处理（实际文件移动）');
  });
})();
</script>

</body>
</html>
